    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but some people say originalism is basically just a way for judges to push their own political agendas by picking whatever history they want. how would a scholar respond to the criticism that it's not actually about the text, but just a tool for partisan outcomes?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
